==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''General''' under {{Faction|Steel Meridian}}, or the rank of '''Partner''' under {{Faction|The Perrin Sequence}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.
*This mod can periodically be acquired from [[The Circuit]].

==Notes==
*Each enemy and {{A|Shadows of the Dead}} hit by Rhino Charge increases Rhino's '''total''' armor value.
*Armor bonus is affected by [[Ability Strength]]. 
*Armor bonus duration is affected by [[Ability Duration]].
*When an armor buff is already applied, charging a second time and receiving another bonus will cancel the first bonus.

==Tips==
*The mentioned "Armor Rating" is a final multiplier to your total armor value after mods, arcanes, and abilities such as {{A|Parasitic Armor}}.
**Example: A [[Steel Fiber]] (+100% armor) on Rhino Prime will net you 580 total armor. Hitting 2 enemies with Rhino Charge and the Ironclad Charge augment equipped will result in +100% Armor Rating for a total of 1160 armor.
*Due to the fact that {{A|Iron Skin}} scales with armor, this can be used to great effect by charging at several enemies, then applying Iron Skin to take advantage of the armor buff. This can result in a much stronger Iron Skin.
*Charging with a large bonus is not suggested, due to the likelihood that the bonus will be replaced by a smaller one.

